---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Koala Source Files
description: Download Xalpheric's Koala sampler project files — open-source beats, sketches, and works-in-progress. Free to use and learn from.
navKoala: true
permalink: /koala-songs.html
---

<section class="section" style="background: var(--bg-base); padding-top: calc(var(--space-section) + 1rem);">
  <div class="starmap-bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 800 280" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
      <!-- Stars scattered like a waveform peak pattern -->
      <circle cx="30" cy="140" r="0.8" fill="#e4d9bc"/>
      <circle cx="80" cy="90" r="1.2" fill="#c47a2a" class="star-pulse"/>
      <circle cx="140" cy="50" r="0.6" fill="#e4d9bc"/>
      <circle cx="195" cy="110" r="0.9" fill="#2a8a9c" class="star-pulse-slow"/>
      <circle cx="255" cy="65" r="0.5" fill="#e4d9bc"/>
      <circle cx="310" cy="30" r="1.1" fill="#c47a2a"/>
      <circle cx="370" cy="85" r="0.7" fill="#e4d9bc"/>
      <circle cx="430" cy="45" r="0.9" fill="#2a8a9c" class="star-pulse-offset"/>
      <circle cx="490" cy="100" r="0.6" fill="#e4d9bc"/>
      <circle cx="545" cy="55" r="1.3" fill="#c47a2a" class="star-pulse"/>
      <circle cx="605" cy="90" r="0.5" fill="#e4d9bc"/>
      <circle cx="660" cy="35" r="0.8" fill="#2a8a9c"/>
      <circle cx="720" cy="75" r="1.0" fill="#c47a2a" class="star-pulse-slow"/>
      <circle cx="775" cy="120" r="0.6" fill="#e4d9bc"/>
      <!-- Mid band -->
      <circle cx="60" cy="190" r="0.7" fill="#2a8a9c"/>
      <circle cx="160" cy="170" r="1.0" fill="#e4d9bc" class="star-pulse-offset"/>
      <circle cx="270" cy="200" r="0.5" fill="#c47a2a"/>
      <circle cx="395" cy="165" r="0.9" fill="#e4d9bc"/>
      <circle cx="510" cy="195" r="0.6" fill="#2a8a9c" class="star-pulse"/>
      <circle cx="625" cy="175" r="1.1" fill="#c47a2a"/>
      <circle cx="745" cy="210" r="0.7" fill="#e4d9bc"/>
      <!-- Waveform-style connecting lines — audio/music theme -->
      <polyline points="80,90 140,50 195,110 255,65 310,30 370,85 430,45 490,100 545,55 605,90 660,35 720,75"
        fill="none" stroke="#c47a2a" stroke-width="0.4" opacity="0.45"/>
      <polyline points="30,140 80,90 195,110 370,85 490,100 605,90 720,75 775,120"
        fill="none" stroke="#2a8a9c" stroke-width="0.3" opacity="0.3"/>
      <!-- Beat marker verticals -->
      <line x1="200" y1="0" x2="200" y2="280" stroke="#2a8a9c" stroke-width="0.25" opacity="0.15"/>
      <line x1="400" y1="0" x2="400" y2="280" stroke="#2a8a9c" stroke-width="0.25" opacity="0.15"/>
      <line x1="600" y1="0" x2="600" y2="280" stroke="#2a8a9c" stroke-width="0.25" opacity="0.15"/>
      <line x1="0" y1="140" x2="800" y2="140" stroke="#2a8a9c" stroke-width="0.25" opacity="0.15"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section__eyebrow">OPEN SOURCE · KOALA SAMPLER</p>
    <h1 class="section__title">Koala Source Files</h1>
    <p class="section__body">
      Every project file from my Koala sampler — beats, sketches, collabs, works-in-progress, and finished tracks. Free to download, learn from, and chop up. Each <code>.koala</code> file opens directly in the <a href="https://www.koalasampler.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--accent-primary);">Koala Sampler</a> iOS app.
    </p>
    <p class="section__body" style="font-family: var(--font-data); font-size: var(--type-caption); color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 0.5rem;">
      {{ koala_songs | length }} files · source: <a href="https://github.com/JasonBBelcher/koala-songs" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--accent-cold);">github.com/JasonBBelcher/koala-songs</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="koala-grid">
      {% for song in koala_songs %}
      <div class="koala-card">
        <div class="koala-card__index">{% if loop.index < 10 %}0{{ loop.index }}{% else %}{{ loop.index }}{% endif %}</div>
        <div class="koala-card__title">{{ song.title }}</div>
        <a class="koala-card__dl download" href="{{ song.url }}" download="{{ song.filename }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Download {{ song.title }}">
          &#8595; Download
        </a>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p style="font-family: var(--font-data); font-size: var(--type-caption); color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 2.5rem; text-align: center;">
      Files served via Git LFS on GitHub. Downloads may be large — some projects include samples.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
